; WASI runtime occupies page 99; 0.8 supplies the expanded symbol layout.
; 0..4194303: source. 4194304..6291455: section/function scratch.
; 6291456..6422527: symbol names and values (64 KiB each).
; 6422528..6488063: parser state and original diagnostics.
; 6488064..6553599: WASI state, diagnostics, and 32 KiB argument text.
